{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/bradmillscan/status/2103108967194833310","id":"2103108967194833310","text":"Stroke of a Pen\n\nI told Opus 5.5 to read my Bitcoin & monetary-history wikis & make a music video with code only.\n\nit used ElevenLabs for the track.\n\nThen a swarm of agents storyboarded and coded a 3:23 portrait reel. ~75 shots cut on the beats.\n\nHad to do 2 revisions - first the people looked like poorly animated stick figures & it rewrote the rigs.\n\nThen I said use matrix code to make it more interesting.\n\nImpressive!","raw_text":{"text":"Stroke of a Pen\n\nI told Opus 5.5 to read my Bitcoin & monetary-history wikis & make a music video with code only.\n\nit used ElevenLabs for the track.\n\nThen a swarm of agents storyboarded and coded a 3:23 portrait reel. ~75 shots cut on the beats.\n\nHad to do 2 revisions - first the people looked like poorly animated stick figures & it rewrote the rigs.\n\nThen I said use matrix code to make it more interesting.\n\nImpressive!","display_text_range":[0,423],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[289,312],"id":"2103107959811133442","display":"pic.x.com/Q2Iht7hi9J","original":"https://t.co/Q2Iht7hi9J","replacement":"https://x.com/bradmillscan/status/2103108967194833310/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"bradmillscan","url":"https://x.com/bradmillscan","id":"246911146","followers":83483,"following":3466,"likes":184821,"media_count":7484,"name":"Brad Mills 🔑⚡️","description":"Bitcoin angel. Building a Citadel Mind & Body through Proof of Work. Nostr + Bitcoin + AI 🦞 🐦","raw_description":{"text":"Bitcoin angel. Building a Citadel Mind & Body through Proof of Work. Nostr + Bitcoin + AI 🦞 🐦","facets":[]},"location":"Cape Breton & London, ON 🇨🇦","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/246911146/1778069201","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2011953806003826688/AnRaiSZU_200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu Feb 03 18:25:17 +0000 2011","protected":false,"website":{"url":"http: